INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('b7adb57a-a776-4b62-83a4-2136bcf51544','What if you could pause time for everyone except you?','You gain a remote that pauses the entire world for up to 24 hours per use, but you still age normally while time is paused. You can use it once per week. How would you use it without losing your mind from isolation?','What If scenarios','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-07T08:17:05.406Z',4);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('cb70cde8-7680-46f6-aea8-776422d5f66a','What if money lost all value tomorrow?','At midnight, every bank account, wallet, and vault becomes worthless. No currency works. The first week after, what skills actually matter and what would people trade?','Fictional situations','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-12T08:17:05.409Z',4);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('5c7ae438-703f-4206-853a-ba3d7d32f72f','Would you erase one embarrassing memory if it also erased the lesson?','A device can delete a single painful memory perfectly, but you will also lose everything you learned from it. Do you press the button? Defend your choice.','Opinion','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-15T08:17:05.411Z',4);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('2df11119-52b2-4d10-883f-067736ca6e15','The elevator puzzle','A building has 10 floors. The elevator is empty and starts at floor 1. 5 people enter at floor 1 and get off at different floors. No two get off at the same floor. What is the minimum number of times the elevator could stop? Explain.','Logic','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-10T08:17:05.413Z',4);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('47f81e97-ec2f-42ef-8c04-903ab1a70eea','Roast your morning routine as if it was a movie trailer','In a world where the alarm is the villain and coffee is the reluctant hero... Give us the most entertaining trailer voiceover for your weekday morning.','Humor','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-13T08:17:05.415Z',4);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('0a96bfde-b756-4787-af83-54b7fb60277f','Is it better to be late and perfect or on time and flawed?','You are leading a team project. Choose a side and defend it with real examples from school, work, or creative life.','Debate','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-18T08:17:05.417Z',6);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('bfd7b3a9-a647-4af1-b855-182f4268e9a3','What if your phone showed how much time people spent thinking about you?','A new app reveals a daily score: minutes others spent thinking about you. Would you check it daily? How would it change your behavior?','Relationships','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-09T08:17:05.419Z',5);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('94c375de-d7e7-4b51-92f5-6c109eedd3ac','School without grades for a semester','Your school removes all grades for one semester and replaces them with detailed feedback only. How would motivation, cheating, and friendships change?','School and everyday life','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-13T08:17:05.421Z',4);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('6514ef3f-7c84-403a-9f01-0f4c4b38b6a8','What if animals could file complaints about humans?','Pigeons, cats, and delivery dogs now have a formal complaint system. Write the most plausible complaint that would be filed this week in your city.','Random scenarios','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-17T08:17:05.423Z',5);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('4d25a756-d53a-4671-9b05-9c4324d6e1ca','What if you could relive one day with full knowledge?','You can pick any single day from your past and live it again with everything you know now, but you cannot change anything after that day ends. Which day and why?','What If scenarios','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-19T08:17:05.424Z',4);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('9db81b67-720c-4dd3-b9e3-618fd8262889','Two doors, one truth','Two advisors give opposite advice about your dream opportunity. One always tells you what you want to hear, the other always tells you what you need to hear. Who do you trust this time and why?','Logic','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-12T08:17:05.426Z',4);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('ac4d4f57-0ff6-4859-8ef2-88d587fba0cd','The group project from hell','One member does nothing, one does everything, one argues about everything. Which role have you actually been? Be honest and make it funny.','School and everyday life','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-13T08:17:05.427Z',4);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('977558ae-c32e-416b-ac2e-c70d945e2d3c','What if dreams were public for 5 minutes after waking?','Every morning, everyone can watch each others dreams for 5 minutes. What new social norms, laws, or apps would appear in the first month?','Fictional situations','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-18T08:17:05.429Z',4);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('41991cbf-df42-490a-bb9b-22429ddf5315','Is humor the best way to handle awkward situations?','Take a clear stance for or against using humor to defuse tension. Use a personal anecdote to prove your point.','Debate','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-09T08:17:05.432Z',5);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('c75c3dc5-82ab-4b01-bf88-080177614821','What if you had to choose one meal to eat forever?','Nutritionally perfect but never changes. You will never get sick of it physically, but mentally? Describe your first month.','Random scenarios','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-20T08:17:05.433Z',4);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('34e3f03f-c095-42f7-9083-8e5c3c167d9f','Confess a small irrational fear','Not the big ones. The tiny weird ones: escalators, typing sounds, the last slice of pizza. Make it relatable.','Relationships','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-14T08:17:05.435Z',4);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('0a0edd24-4d8e-4f03-8d39-ee7c54922889','What if you could text your past self one sentence?','You get 120 characters to send to yourself exactly 5 years ago. What do you write so past-you actually listens?','What If scenarios','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-13T08:17:05.437Z',4);
INSERT INTO "challenges" VALUES('a81371db-964f-4c17-ae7e-e3cb5f20882a','The perfect lie','Create a harmless lie that would make everyday life slightly more entertaining if everyone believed it for 24 hours.','Humor','active','44e5b143-556a-41b6-bfa1-5099f1365c18','2026-08-16T08:17:05.439Z',4);
