INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('3232950c-e803-4fa4-99f6-5e9d6d749c56','c75c3dc5-82ab-4b01-bf88-080177614821','4616e52f-719c-4cab-bea8-7a6f324246ac','In a world where snooze is survival and toast is a ticking clock, one student must make it to class with mismatched socks.',5,'2026-08-20T08:17:05.570Z','2026-08-20T08:17:05.570Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('fbeb76f2-bee0-44b5-840c-56184a0a5906','c75c3dc5-82ab-4b01-bf88-080177614821','ad55daa6-9bc1-4269-9267-5e80c4006818','On time and flawed beats late and perfect every time. Perfection after the deadline is just a polished failure.',0,'2026-08-20T08:17:05.573Z','2026-08-20T08:17:05.573Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('6c5e067c-47e2-4131-8247-0ff251c83469','cb70cde8-7680-46f6-aea8-776422d5f66a','4616e52f-719c-4cab-bea8-7a6f324246ac','On time and flawed beats late and perfect every time. Perfection after the deadline is just a polished failure.',8,'2026-08-20T08:17:05.577Z','2026-08-20T08:17:05.577Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('6ab6db43-8fcb-48e4-bd5c-2b0f9bdb31c1','b7adb57a-a776-4b62-83a4-2136bcf51544','0b34cc05-1eef-4e46-8175-8b13e2665d3b','The isolation is the point — it reveals whether you actually want more time or just less pressure. I would use one pause to do deep work, then decide if I ever want to again.',2,'2026-08-19T08:40:54.510Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.510Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('7a85a6cc-5330-4848-98b3-6b89a03f0578','b7adb57a-a776-4b62-83a4-2136bcf51544','2844975e-8991-4303-9ec0-24a3ab6a774d','I would save it for decisions with irreversible consequences. Using it weekly would erode urgency, and urgency is what makes time meaningful in the first place.',1,'2026-08-16T08:40:54.520Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.520Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('5983737a-13ee-40da-9dc4-f88938167417','cb70cde8-7680-46f6-aea8-776422d5f66a','0e17f525-46bb-473f-94bd-de006406d4b9','Day three: pigeons unionize, cats file noise complaints about vacuums, and a city app appears called ComplaintBird. By month one, humans learn to negotiate with crows over trash routes.',1,'2026-08-17T08:40:54.531Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.531Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('b48a5e97-2235-4810-87d5-53ecf58acd46','cb70cde8-7680-46f6-aea8-776422d5f66a','7d3b502b-3864-4b9d-986b-bd3fa5ed3171','Pigeon complaint #042: Human installed spikes on my favorite ledge and then complained I was loitering. Requesting alternative perch and a formal apology with breadcrumbs.',1,'2026-08-16T08:40:54.540Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.540Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('bfd1dcd1-725c-4891-8fa1-1ad7f0e4921c','cb70cde8-7680-46f6-aea8-776422d5f66a','2844975e-8991-4303-9ec0-24a3ab6a774d','Day three: pigeons unionize, cats file noise complaints about vacuums, and a city app appears called ComplaintBird. By month one, humans learn to negotiate with crows over trash routes.',7,'2026-08-19T08:40:54.568Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.568Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('202232c6-848d-4c40-b4ac-1bae7a3c2e22','5c7ae438-703f-4206-853a-ba3d7d32f72f','08bab6a9-c3ba-49f9-889e-b352665d0e50','Press it only if the memory keeps you from trying again. Otherwise the lesson is cheaper to keep than the risk of relearning it from scratch.',8,'2026-08-20T08:40:54.591Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.591Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('be0faed0-f024-46f4-a85a-b10f89a15131','5c7ae438-703f-4206-853a-ba3d7d32f72f','7d3b502b-3864-4b9d-986b-bd3fa5ed3171','Delete the emotion, keep the story. But since the device does not allow that split, I would decline — the lesson without the feeling is just a slogan.',6,'2026-08-20T08:40:54.602Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.602Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('b0fcbfb7-bd94-47ed-a036-b0b9fc523ff6','5c7ae438-703f-4206-853a-ba3d7d32f72f','0e17f525-46bb-473f-94bd-de006406d4b9','I would not erase it. The sting is what makes the lesson stick. Without the memory, I would likely repeat the pattern in a subtler form and call it a new mistake.',6,'2026-08-16T08:40:54.611Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.611Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('38cd8a02-f732-48e2-a95c-5dc76824aa88','2df11119-52b2-4d10-883f-067736ca6e15','2844975e-8991-4303-9ec0-24a3ab6a774d','Think in sets: 5 people, 5 distinct floors, elevator starts at 1. Best case they exit at 2,3,4,5,6 — that is 5 stops. Any higher spread still needs 5, so lower bound is 5.',1,'2026-08-16T08:40:54.619Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.619Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('c5004622-754f-4f1b-a920-38a3f6223a1b','2df11119-52b2-4d10-883f-067736ca6e15','0b34cc05-1eef-4e46-8175-8b13e2665d3b','Minimum is 5 stops after floor 1 if the elevator can skip empty floors. Each person needs a distinct floor, so you need 5 distinct drop-offs. Starting floor does not count as a stop unless someone exits there.',1,'2026-08-17T08:40:54.626Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.626Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('366d76b6-eff8-476c-ac2b-f3657aac98f6','47f81e97-ec2f-42ef-8c04-903ab1a70eea','2844975e-8991-4303-9ec0-24a3ab6a774d','I would narrate my routine as a heist: The crew (me, half-awake) must extract the keys, bypass the kitchen chaos, and reach the door before the bus leaves without them.',5,'2026-08-19T08:40:54.633Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.633Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('f1ffa657-1ad9-486a-9cf4-97dbf6dd1b48','47f81e97-ec2f-42ef-8c04-903ab1a70eea','6ecae851-f8dd-43fa-b81b-f66eabaf7880','Alarm as villain, coffee as reluctant hero, inbox as the twist villain. I would trailer it with: He thought he had time. He was wrong. He had 8 minutes and a missing charger.',3,'2026-08-17T08:40:54.641Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.641Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('ea7d00af-bd5d-4ec6-ba6c-9ec729a2e247','47f81e97-ec2f-42ef-8c04-903ab1a70eea','0b34cc05-1eef-4e46-8175-8b13e2665d3b','NARRATOR: In a world where snooze is a survival skill and the toothpaste tube is a nemesis, one human must survive the 7:12 bus with one sock inside out. Coming this fall: The Morning.',4,'2026-08-18T08:40:54.650Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.650Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('60d2471c-199a-4c32-a68c-1873573f633a','0a96bfde-b756-4787-af83-54b7fb60277f','08bab6a9-c3ba-49f9-889e-b352665d0e50','On time and flawed wins. A shipped draft can be iterated, a perfect draft delivered late is a missed opportunity. Deadlines are trust, perfection is negotiable.',7,'2026-08-18T08:40:54.658Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.658Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('9265ec62-f849-4451-baba-595aa9b320cf','0a96bfde-b756-4787-af83-54b7fb60277f','6ecae851-f8dd-43fa-b81b-f66eabaf7880','Perfection after the deadline is just a polished failure. Ship, learn, then make the next one better — that is how progress compounds.',2,'2026-08-17T08:40:54.666Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.666Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('71c292bb-5290-428c-909b-b5459354af50','0a96bfde-b756-4787-af83-54b7fb60277f','7d3b502b-3864-4b9d-986b-bd3fa5ed3171','Perfection after the deadline is just a polished failure. Ship, learn, then make the next one better — that is how progress compounds.',7,'2026-08-16T08:40:54.675Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.675Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('9653d88a-25d1-45f5-a3d6-e79c647592f8','bfd7b3a9-a647-4af1-b855-182f4268e9a3','08bab6a9-c3ba-49f9-889e-b352665d0e50','I would check it once, then regret it. The healthiest move would be to treat the number as data about them, not value about me — which is easier said than done.',6,'2026-08-19T08:40:54.682Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.682Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('9f65e050-6ece-494d-984b-57e716f60263','94c375de-d7e7-4b51-92f5-6c109eedd3ac','2844975e-8991-4303-9ec0-24a3ab6a774d','Without grades, curiosity comes back for a week, then anxiety shifts to who gets the most detailed feedback. The ambitious would still compete, just with words instead of numbers.',6,'2026-08-20T08:40:54.690Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.690Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('33b10770-bb34-493b-a7e1-2622d0377f66','6514ef3f-7c84-403a-9f01-0f4c4b38b6a8','0e17f525-46bb-473f-94bd-de006406d4b9','The complaint would be: Dog files grievance that human says good boy only when filming. Requests consistent good boy distribution and extra walks without phones.',9,'2026-08-17T08:40:54.697Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.697Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('77ea5752-6648-4ff7-8ef7-5ff90834a642','6514ef3f-7c84-403a-9f01-0f4c4b38b6a8','0b34cc05-1eef-4e46-8175-8b13e2665d3b','I would choose the meal that is most adjustable — maybe a bowl that can be warm or cold, eaten fast or slow — and then make variety through context, not content.',1,'2026-08-18T08:40:54.705Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.705Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('87d428df-876f-4718-b549-baa07b0b3a46','9db81b67-720c-4dd3-b9e3-618fd8262889','0b34cc05-1eef-4e46-8175-8b13e2665d3b','I would brute force the logic: distinct floors means at least 5 unique stops. Add the start only if you count it. So answer is 5, or 6 counting the boarding.',2,'2026-08-17T08:40:54.712Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.712Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('bddca6ae-56a2-4e1e-8e06-f7ddd0384c4f','9db81b67-720c-4dd3-b9e3-618fd8262889','2844975e-8991-4303-9ec0-24a3ab6a774d','Minimum is 5 stops after floor 1 if the elevator can skip empty floors. Each person needs a distinct floor, so you need 5 distinct drop-offs. Starting floor does not count as a stop unless someone exits there.',3,'2026-08-16T08:40:54.720Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.720Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('6f7f1ef5-0639-4862-853b-e1b95e087381','9db81b67-720c-4dd3-b9e3-618fd8262889','6ecae851-f8dd-43fa-b81b-f66eabaf7880','Minimum is 5 stops after floor 1 if the elevator can skip empty floors. Each person needs a distinct floor, so you need 5 distinct drop-offs. Starting floor does not count as a stop unless someone exits there.',2,'2026-08-19T08:40:54.728Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.728Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('e2b1be81-0265-4e92-8182-df49ffd5c32b','ac4d4f57-0ff6-4859-8ef2-88d587fba0cd','08bab6a9-c3ba-49f9-889e-b352665d0e50','Feedback over grades would help the middle quietly and stress the top loudly. The real change would be parents asking what did you learn instead of what did you get.',6,'2026-08-19T08:40:54.737Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.737Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('3c31617e-abe0-43a3-ae35-353108418f70','ac4d4f57-0ff6-4859-8ef2-88d587fba0cd','2844975e-8991-4303-9ec0-24a3ab6a774d','I was the one doing everything, telling myself it was faster than delegating. It was also lonelier. I now set a rule: if I do more than 60 percent, I have failed at collaboration.',8,'2026-08-16T08:40:54.744Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.744Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('ea8ad0fd-a5e0-4d3e-833f-688dc1f02aa9','977558ae-c32e-416b-ac2e-c70d945e2d3c','08bab6a9-c3ba-49f9-889e-b352665d0e50','Trade would go hyperlocal: repair, food, medicine, teaching. The first week would be barter, the second week would be reputation. The people who can fix things quietly would become central.',8,'2026-08-17T08:40:54.752Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.752Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('87ec6f19-bec3-434b-ab21-1af71c36bb0b','41991cbf-df42-490a-bb9b-22429ddf5315','0b34cc05-1eef-4e46-8175-8b13e2665d3b','Choose on time and flawed for teams, late and perfect for solo craft. The cost of being late is multiplied by everyone waiting.',1,'2026-08-20T08:40:54.760Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.760Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('920f8a71-c582-4bce-baff-ad8f000eae45','41991cbf-df42-490a-bb9b-22429ddf5315','08bab6a9-c3ba-49f9-889e-b352665d0e50','Choose on time and flawed for teams, late and perfect for solo craft. The cost of being late is multiplied by everyone waiting.',6,'2026-08-16T08:40:54.772Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.772Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('c98e3c1d-8004-40ce-8161-cf32aecb8a94','c75c3dc5-82ab-4b01-bf88-080177614821','0e17f525-46bb-473f-94bd-de006406d4b9','One meal forever would be a slow negotiation with boredom. Nutritionally perfect does not fix the need for variety. I would ritualize it: different plating, different time, same food, new story.',8,'2026-08-16T08:40:54.779Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.779Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('8b80cff5-3a4f-4f97-9bf7-feae268b1d78','34e3f03f-c095-42f7-9083-8e5c3c167d9f','0e17f525-46bb-473f-94bd-de006406d4b9','I would check it once, then regret it. The healthiest move would be to treat the number as data about them, not value about me — which is easier said than done.',1,'2026-08-17T08:40:54.787Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.787Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('f99cbc16-1021-4d7c-8b5c-3e0265182d2e','0a0edd24-4d8e-4f03-8d39-ee7c54922889','0b34cc05-1eef-4e46-8175-8b13e2665d3b','Pause once to prepare, not to escape. I would spend the first hour listing what would happen if everyone did what I am about to do, then act only if the answer still holds.',6,'2026-08-17T08:40:54.795Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.795Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('0e364ed8-b10e-4fc3-b4d2-986f090db170','a81371db-964f-4c17-ae7e-e3cb5f20882a','7d3b502b-3864-4b9d-986b-bd3fa5ed3171','NARRATOR: In a world where snooze is a survival skill and the toothpaste tube is a nemesis, one human must survive the 7:12 bus with one sock inside out. Coming this fall: The Morning.',7,'2026-08-16T08:40:54.803Z','2026-08-20T08:40:54.803Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('cd187a07-fe41-4228-adf0-73e58dab0b87','6514ef3f-7c84-403a-9f01-0f4c4b38b6a8','2844975e-8991-4303-9ec0-24a3ab6a774d','I would choose the meal that is most adjustable — maybe a bowl that can be warm or cold, eaten fast or slow — and then make variety through context, not content.',1,'2026-08-20T08:46:44.957Z','2026-08-20T08:46:44.957Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('4e53cbd8-a560-4f34-b77f-31c1a6433f57','41991cbf-df42-490a-bb9b-22429ddf5315','7d3b502b-3864-4b9d-986b-bd3fa5ed3171','Perfection after the deadline is just a polished failure. Ship, learn, then make the next one better — that is how progress compounds.',0,'2026-08-20T08:47:19.972Z','2026-08-20T08:47:19.972Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('ced07c78-220a-4226-8d6e-91ce9f1384b6','0a96bfde-b756-4787-af83-54b7fb60277f','0e17f525-46bb-473f-94bd-de006406d4b9','Late and perfect only works if everyone agrees perfection was worth the wait — they rarely do. I would rather be accountable and early, then revise in public.',0,'2026-08-20T08:54:46.916Z','2026-08-20T08:54:46.916Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('b0247037-4a6c-42ad-a9e3-afc608306e6c','ac4d4f57-0ff6-4859-8ef2-88d587fba0cd','6ecae851-f8dd-43fa-b81b-f66eabaf7880','I learned to split work by energy, not fairness: do the hard part when you are sharp, the easy part when you are tired, and always leave a trace of your reasoning for the next person.',4,'2026-08-19T09:00:14.853Z','2026-08-20T09:00:14.853Z');
INSERT INTO "answers" VALUES('3b87dc15-7ef2-4f41-9c44-db46f670bb07','bfd7b3a9-a647-4af1-b855-182f4268e9a3','2844975e-8991-4303-9ec0-24a3ab6a774d','Humor defuses, but only if everyone is in on the joke. My rule: if power is unequal, humor is not neutral. I would default to clarity, then add lightness once safety is clear.',0,'2026-08-20T09:00:22.891Z','2026-08-20T09:00:22.891Z');
